= [+ year +] 年纳粹党代表大会

After abandoning revolutionary tactics with the failure of the Beer Hall Putsch and instead attempting to subvert democracy from within through hardline, non-compromising parliamentary participation, the Nazis have seen their tactics yet again fail.

Now, emerging from a long period of internal re-consolidation, the Nazis have unveiled their new party manifesto. On the surface a significant moderation, [+ nsdap_leader +]'s convictions and those of his party remain unchanged. The Nazis have simply undergone the next natural change in the strategy for destroying democracy, becoming a true trojan horse.

- @concern: 事态堪忧。
